# Language
  Identifier: sem-lang/standard/pipeline
  Version: 0.10.0
  Dependencies: sem-lang/standard/semantic

# Term
  Name: Pipeline
  Description: A typed declarative data flow
  Meaning: Primitive/Composition

# Term
  Name: PipelineSource
  Description: The value or collection entering a pipeline
  Meaning: Primitive/Reference

# Term
  Name: PipelineSelect
  Description: A constraint that narrows a collection
  Meaning: Primitive/Predicate

# Term
  Name: PipelineTransform
  Description: A typed value transformation
  Meaning: Primitive/Relation

# Term
  Name: PipelineExpand
  Description: A collection-producing transformation flattened into its flow
  Meaning: Primitive/Relation

# Term
  Name: PipelineAggregate
  Description: A typed reduction or grouping
  Meaning: Primitive/Relation

# Term
  Name: PipelineEffect
  Description: The explicit external effect boundary of a pipeline
  Meaning: Primitive/Relation

# Term
  Name: PipelineResult
  Description: The typed result exposed by a pipeline
  Meaning: Primitive/Value
